  "about_devChannel": "Developer channel",
  "about_disclaimerP": "This is an unofficial fan-made wiki. Phantom Blade Zero is developed by S-Game. All game content, names, and imagery are trademarks or copyrights of their respective owners. This wiki is intended for informational purposes only and does not claim ownership of any game assets.",
  "about_disclaimerTitle": "Disclaimer",
  "about_gameP1": "Phantom Blade Zero is a Kungfupunk action RPG developed by S-Game, built on Unreal Engine 5. Set in the Phantom World — a universe blending Chinese Wuxia, steampunk machinery, dark fantasy, and folk horror — you play as Soul, an elite assassin framed for the patriarch's murder with only 66 days to live.",
  "about_gameP2": "Inspired by the Golden Age of Hong Kong martial arts cinema, the combat features authentic motion capture, color-coded defensive maneuvers, the signature Ghostep repositioning counter, and over 30 unique weapons. With 8 distinct endings shaped by side quest choices and multiple difficulty modes including Hellwalker, Phantom Blade Zero delivers a deeply replayable single-player experience.",
  "about_gameTitle": "About Phantom Blade Zero",
