  "explore_all_guides": "Explore All Guides",
  "explore_more": "Explore More",
  "faq_boss": "Can I rematch bosses?",
  "faq_boss_answer": "Yes. Phantom Blade Zero features a boss rematch system. In the second phase, bosses respawn, allowing you to repeat encounters and practice their attack patterns. Some bosses can also be skipped, though this affects the story and endings.",
  "faq_combat": "Is Phantom Blade Zero a Soulslike?",
  "faq_combat_answer": "No. S-Game has stated that Phantom Blade Zero is NOT a Soulslike. It features color-coded defensive maneuvers (parry brutal orange attacks, dodge killer red attacks), the Ghostep repositioning counter, and a Sha-Chi meter instead of stamina. The combat is more akin to action games like Devil May Cry and Ninja Gaiden with Wuxia film inspiration.",
  "faq_difficulty": "What difficulty modes are available?",
  "faq_difficulty_answer": "Phantom Blade Zero offers 4 difficulty modes including Hellwalker for the most challenging experience. There is also a New Game Plus mode with new content and weapon upgrades. The difficulty scaling uses dynamic AI behavior, so enemies adapt to your skill level.",
  "faq_endings": "How many endings does Phantom Blade Zero have?",
  "faq_endings_answer": "Phantom Blade Zero has 8 distinct endings. Side quests directly affect the main story outcome, meaning your choices and quest completion determine which ending you get. This is more endings than Elden Ring, and encourages multiple playthroughs.",
  "faq_ghostep": "What is Ghostep?",
  "faq_ghostep_answer": "Ghostep is Phantom Blade Zero's signature counter-attack mechanic. After a successful parry or dodge, Ghostep allows you to reposition behind or beside the enemy for a devastating counter. It blurs the line between offense and defense, creating a fluid combat rhythm.",
  "faq_length": "How long is Phantom Blade Zero?",
  "faq_length_answer": "The main campaign takes approximately 30-40 hours. With multiple endings, New Game Plus, and Hellwalker difficulty, completionists can expect significantly more playtime across multiple playthroughs.",
  "faq_platforms": "What platforms is Phantom Blade Zero available on?",
  "faq_platforms_answer": "Phantom Blade Zero launches on PS5 and PC (Steam & Epic Games Store) on October 29, 2026. It is a PS5 console exclusive for 12 months. A physical disc release is also planned.",
  "faq_shaChi": "What is the Sha-Chi system?",
  "faq_shaChi_answer": "Sha-Chi replaces the traditional stamina system. It governs your combat abilities and must be managed carefully. When your Sha-Chi is depleted by enemy attacks, you enter a Breached state. Managing Sha-Chi effectively is key to mastering the combat flow.",
  "faq_story": "What is the story of Phantom Blade Zero?",
  "faq_story_answer": "You play as Soul, an elite assassin of The Order who is framed for the patriarch's murder and given only 66 days to live. The game explores the conspiracy behind the murder, Soul's quest for truth, and the shifting realities of the Phantom World. The Kungfupunk setting blends Chinese Wuxia traditions with steampunk and dark fantasy elements.",
  "faq_weapons": "How many weapons are in Phantom Blade Zero?",
  "faq_weapons_answer": "Phantom Blade Zero features over 30 primary weapons (blades) and 20+ secondary weapons (Phantom Edges). Primary weapons include longswords, chakrams, greatswords, and whip swords. Phantom Edges are secondary weapons like bows, halberds, warhammers, and lion masks obtained from boss drops.",
  "featured_guides": "Featured Guides",
  "footer_about": "A community-driven wiki dedicated to Phantom Blade Zero, the Kungfupunk action RPG by S-Game. We provide comprehensive combat guides, weapon databases, boss strategies, and ending walkthroughs to help players survive Soul's 66-day journey.",
